---
import Container from "../shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../shared/Paragraph.astro";
import ByNumber from "./ByNumber.astro";
import BtnLinkStart from "../shared/BtnLinkStart.astro";
---

<section class="relative pt-32 lg:pt-36">
  <Container className={"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 lg:gap-12"}>
    <div class="absolute w-full lg:w-1/2 inset-y-0 lg:right-0">
      <span
        class="absolute -left-6 md:left-4 top-24 lg:top-28 w-24 h-24 rotate-90 skew-x-12 rounded-3xl bg-red-300 blur-xl opacity-60 lg:opacity-95 lg:block hidden"
      ></span>
      <span
        class="absolute right-4 bottom-12 w-24 h-24 rounded-3xl bg-blue-500 blur-xl opacity-80"
      ></span>
    </div>
    <span
      class="w-4/12 lg:w-3/12 aspect-square bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-400 to-green-400 absolute -top-5 lg:left-0 rounded-full skew-y-12 blur-2xl opacity-40 skew-x-12 rotate-90"
    ></span>
    <div
      class="relative flex flex-col text-left lg:py-7 xl:py-8
        items-start lg:max-w-none max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 lg:flex-1 lg:w-1/2"
    >
      <h1
        class="text-5xl/tight sm:text-6xl/tight md:text-5xl/tight xl:text-6xl/tight
             font-bold text-heading-1"
      >
        M365 Administration Bootcamp:
        <span
          class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 from-20% via-primary via-5% to-green-500"
          >6 Weeks to Mastery</span
        >
      </h1>
      <mark
        class="border border-pink-500 bg-white p-0.5 rounded font-bold pr-1 pl-1"
        ><i class="fa fa-bullhorn text-pink-500 font-bold"></i> Starts on 1st June, 2026</mark
      >
      <Paragraph className="mt-5">
        In six weeks, you’ll progress from basic familiarity to confident
        administration of core Microsoft 365 services, including Outlook, Teams,
        SharePoint, OneDrive, Power Automate, and Power BI. Each session is
        built around real-world administrative scenarios—equipping you not just
        to understand the platform, but to effectively manage users, secure
        data, optimize environments, and resolve everyday operational
        challenges.
      </Paragraph>
      <div
        class="mt-5 w-full flex flex-row max-w-full mx-auto lg:mx-0 space-x-4"
      >
        <div class="lg:min-w-max flex lg:items-center sm:w-max w-full">
          <BtnLinkStart
            text="Explore Your Learning Path"
            href="#services"
            className="flex justify-center w-full sm:w-max"
            variant="primary"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="lg:min-w-max flex lg:items-center sm:w-max w-full lg:pb-0 border-b border-box-bg lg:border-0 lg:px-0"
        >
          <button
            data-tally-open="gDkNGO"
            data-tally-layout="modal"
            data-tally-width="500"
            data-tally-hide-title="1"
            data-tally-emoji-text="👋"
            data-tally-emoji-animation="wave"
            data-tally-auto-close="0"
            data-tally-form-events-forwarding="1"
            class="bg-primary text-white text-sm
            md:text-md
            px-6
            py-3
            rounded-full
            outline-none
            relative
            overflow-hidden
            duration-300
            ease-linear
            z-0
            after:absolute
            after:inset-x-0
            after:aspect-square
            after:scale-0
            after:opacity-70
            after:origin-center
            after:duration-300
            after:ease-linear
            after:rounded-full
            after:top-0
            after:left-0
            after:bg-[#172554]
            after:z-[-1]
            hover:text-white
            hover:after:opacity-100
            hover:after:scale-[2.5]"
          >
            <span class="relative z-10"> Register Now </span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-1 lg:w-1/2 lg:h-auto relative lg:max-w-none lg:mx-0 mx-auto max-w-3xl"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/boot.jpg"
        alt="Hero image"
        width="2350"
        height="2359"
        class="lg:absolute lg:w-full lg:h-full rounded-3xl lg:rounded-full object-cover lg:max-h-none max-h-96"
      />
    </div>
  </Container>

  <ByNumber />
</section>
